  "subtopic": "results",
  "title": "Names of internal linkage",
  "summary": "Search finds the names of internal linkage at namespace scope, in every file declaring one, but never a function's locals",
  "prose": "A `static` variable or a member of an anonymous namespace is known only to\nits own file, yet it is a name the project declares: search lists it, once\nper file that declares one. A local variable is not.",
